{"seq":1,"slug":"unfinished","title":"未竟与拖延","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/unfinished","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-unfinished-works","title":"未竟的作品","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/unfinished/the-unfinished-works","wordCount":1702,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"procrastination-and-perfectionism","title":"拖延与完美主义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/unfinished/procrastination-and-perfectionism","wordCount":1731,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"未竟与拖延\">未竟与拖延</h1><p>达·芬奇留下大量未竟之作，这是其传奇中引人深思的一面。本章直面这一特征。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;未竟的作品&quot;——他大量作品未能完成背后，那颗永不满足之心灵的奥秘。第二篇文档讲述&quot;拖延与完美主义&quot;,剖析这对特质如何与他的旷世才华密不可分。</p>\n"}